			id="5.2.3.4 Prepared food"
			parent="5.2.3 Types of food">
			<description>
				<form
					lang="en">
					<text>Use this domain for words referring to prepared food. Cultures vary widely in the number and types of foods they prepare, and in how they classify them. For instance the English distinction between main dish and side dish is not found in the classification system of other languages. If your language has well-recognized subcategories, you can set up a separate subdomain for each. The questions below are based on the main ingredient in the dish.</text>
				</form>
			</description>
			<label>
				<form
					lang="en">
					<text>Prepared food</text>
				</form>
